{"id":1349,"date":"2026-08-22T20:19:37","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T20:19:37","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1349"},"modified":"2026-08-22T20:52:11","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T20:52:11","slug":"rulers-ruler-origin","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/rulers-ruler-origin\/","title":{"rendered":"Rulers &#038; Ruler Origin"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Rulers &amp; Ruler Origin<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1357\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RulersAndRulerOrigin.webp\" alt=\"Rulers &amp; Ruler Origin\" width=\"116\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RulersAndRulerOrigin.webp 958w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RulersAndRulerOrigin-292x300.webp 292w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/RulersAndRulerOrigin-768x788.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 116px) 100vw, 116px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Pixel rulers run along the top and left edges of the canvas, giving you a precise spatial reference while you work. The ruler origin can be repositioned to any point on the page for even more accurate placement.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Showing &amp; Hiding Rulers<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1352\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-211914.png\" alt=\"Showing &amp; Hiding Rulers\" width=\"375\" height=\"111\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-211914.png 949w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-211914-300x89.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-211914-768x227.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 375px) 100vw, 375px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To show or hide rulers:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>View &gt; Show &gt; Rulers<\/strong>, or<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Right-click in the workspace background and select <strong>Show\/Hide Rulers<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Custom Ruler Origin (Zero Point)<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1355\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/rigin.webp\" alt=\"Custom Ruler Origin (Zero Point)\" width=\"160\" height=\"164\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/rigin.webp 458w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/rigin-293x300.webp 293w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 160px) 100vw, 160px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">By default, the ruler&#8217;s 0,0 origin sits at the top-left corner of the canvas. You can redefine this origin to any point on the page:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Drag the grey intersection box where the horizontal and vertical rulers meet, at the very top-left corner of the canvas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">As you drag, dashed guide lines follow your cursor across the page to help you visually pinpoint the target coordinates.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Release to set the new zero point. All ruler ticks and labels immediately recalculate from the new origin.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Double-click the intersection box at any time to instantly reset the rulers back to their default position.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">Your custom ruler origin is saved into the <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">.opub<\/span> file and persists across sessions.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Rulers &amp; Ruler Origin Pixel rulers run along the top and left edges of the canvas, giving you a precise spatial reference while you work. The ruler origin can be repositioned to any point on the page for even more accurate placement. Showing &amp; Hiding Rulers To show or hide rulers: Go to View &gt; [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1357,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-1349","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1349","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1349"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1349\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1361,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1349\/revisions\/1361"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1357"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1349"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1349"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}